### PoMemeVideo API — Consolidated HTTP requests
### Use with VS Code REST Client or JetBrains HTTP Client
### All slices in one file; per-slice files are deleted.

@host = http://localhost:7000
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  AUTH
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### POST /auth/guest — Create GUEST identity (dev only)
POST {{host}}/auth/guest
Content-Type: application/json

###

### POST /auth/anon — Backward-compatible alias
POST {{host}}/auth/anon
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET /api/auth/me — Current signed-in user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

###

### POST /auth/logout — Sign out
POST {{host}}/auth/logout

###

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  CONFIG
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### GET /api/config — Feature flags and environment info
GET {{host}}/api/config

###

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  INGESTION
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### POST /api/ingestion/sas — Generate SAS token for video upload (mp4)
POST {{host}}/api/ingestion/sas
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fileName": "my-video.mp4",
    "fileSizeBytes": 104857600
}

###

### POST /api/ingestion/sas — Invalid extension (expect 400 INVALID_EXTENSION)
POST {{host}}/api/ingestion/sas
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fileName": "exploit.exe",
    "fileSizeBytes": 1024
}

###

### POST /api/ingestion/sessions — Confirm session after upload
POST {{host}}/api/ingestion/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
    "blobPath": "sessions/{{sessionId}}/source.mp4",
    "videoDurationSeconds": 42.5,
    "aggressiveVisuals": true
}

###

### GET /api/ingestion/sessions/{id} — Get session status
GET {{host}}/api/ingestion/sessions/{{sessionId}}

###

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  PROCESSING
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### POST /api/processing/sessions/{id}/initiate — Start engine
POST {{host}}/api/processing/sessions/{{sessionId}}/initiate
Content-Type: application/json

###

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  OUTPUT
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### GET /api/output/sessions/{id}/script — Director's Script
GET {{host}}/api/output/sessions/{{sessionId}}/script

###

### GET /api/output/sessions/{id}/download/video — Download output MP4
GET {{host}}/api/output/sessions/{{sessionId}}/download/video

###

### GET /api/output/sessions/{id}/download/script — Download script JSON
GET {{host}}/api/output/sessions/{{sessionId}}/download/script

###

### DELETE /api/output/sessions/{id} — Delete session and all blobs
DELETE {{host}}/api/output/sessions/{{sessionId}}

###

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  MEME LIBRARY
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### GET /api/memelibrary/sounds — List all sounds
GET {{host}}/api/memelibrary/sounds
Accept: application/json

###

### GET /api/memelibrary/sounds — Filtered by tags
GET {{host}}/api/memelibrary/sounds?tags=impact,boom&limit=10
Accept: application/json

###

### POST /api/memelibrary/seed — Seed sound library from disk
POST {{host}}/api/memelibrary/seed
Content-Type: application/json

###
